WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.119
Bird was looking for Kip.

2
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:23.023
Kip was looking for Bird.

3
00:00:23.024 --> 00:00:39.660
Bird looked near the giant rock first.

4
00:00:39.661 --> 00:00:43.193
Then she looked near the playground.

5
00:00:43.194 --> 00:00:53.582
"Where is Kip?" she wondered.

6
00:00:53.583 --> 00:01:00.313
Kip looked near the playground first.

7
00:01:00.314 --> 00:01:09.220
Then he looked near the giant rock.

8
00:01:09.221 --> 00:01:20.313
"Where is Bird?" he wondered.

9
00:01:20.314 --> 00:01:26.120
Bird saw Mouse.

10
00:01:26.121 --> 00:01:30.332
"Have you seen Kip?" asked Bird.

11
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:33.325
"Yes, I have," said Mouse.

12
00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:43.456
"I saw Kip near the giant rock."

13
00:01:43.457 --> 00:01:45.473
Kip saw Squirrel.

14
00:01:45.474 --> 00:01:48.518
"Have you seen Bird?" asked Kip.

15
00:01:48.519 --> 00:01:51.499
"Yes, I have," said Squirrel.

16
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:56.981
"I saw Bird near the playground."

17
00:01:56.982 --> 00:02:01.655
Kip went back to the playground.

18
00:02:01.656 --> 00:02:10.055
He didn't see Bird.

19
00:02:10.056 --> 00:02:17.696
Bird went back to the giant rock.

20
00:02:17.697 --> 00:02:23.311
She didn't see Kip.

21
00:02:23.312 --> 00:02:28.510
"Oh well," said Kip.

22
00:02:28.511 --> 00:02:36.555
"I'll go to the aquarium by myself."

23
00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:40.592
"Oh well," said Bird.

24
00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:46.164
"I'll go to the aquarium by myself."

